MOOSPKG 1
name: demos
@file countdown.ms 116
# countdown.ms - a launch countdown
set t = 10
while t > 0
  print "T minus" t
  set t = t - 1
end
print "Liftoff!"

@file demos.txt 270
MOOS demo scripts, installed from GitHub with:  apt install /treedev10/moos

  run primes.ms      prime numbers below 60
  run fizzbuzz.ms    FizzBuzz from 1 to 20
  run countdown.ms   a launch countdown

Open them in the Script IDE or with  edit  to see how they work.

@file fizzbuzz.ms 269
# fizzbuzz.ms - the classic, from 1 to 20
set i = 1
while i <= 20
  if i % 15 == 0
    print "FizzBuzz"
  else
    if i % 3 == 0
      print "Fizz"
    else
      if i % 5 == 0
        print "Buzz"
      else
        print i
      end
    end
  end
  set i = i + 1
end

@file primes.ms 236
# primes.ms - print the prime numbers below 60
set n = 2
while n < 60
  set d = 2
  set prime = 1
  while d * d <= n
    if n % d == 0
      set prime = 0
    end
    set d = d + 1
  end
  if prime
    print n
  end
  set n = n + 1
end

@end
